POSIX: the POSIX functions (process, user and group IDs, terminals,
...).

The module posix of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20240924/posix.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d, its
headers in include/php84/php/ext/posix.
